WEBVTT

00:10.730 --> 00:16.030
<i>When I throw a jab or a straight,
 it always lands</i>

00:16.030 --> 00:21.160
<i>But when I'm aiming for your heart,
 I miss every time</i>

00:21.160 --> 00:26.500
<i>Parallel, zigzagging, awkward, incoherent</i>

00:26.500 --> 00:31.010
<i>When you look my way and move closer to me</i>

00:31.010 --> 00:36.760
<i>I know it doesn't mean the same thing for you</i>

00:36.760 --> 00:41.810
<i>But I wish we could stay like this forever</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:47.940
<i>My changing feelings are driving me crazy</i>

00:47.940 --> 00:53.240
<i>The moment you turn to face me,
 take that! Telepathy</i>

00:53.240 --> 00:58.700
<i>If only we could feel the same thing</i>

00:58.700 --> 01:03.580
<i>I want to kick this pesky subtlety away</i>

01:03.580 --> 01:09.590
<i>I want to know everything, 
I want to know everything</i>

01:09.590 --> 01:12.130
<i>I can't fool you forever</i>

01:12.130 --> 01:14.760
<i>I can't keep this hidden</i>

01:14.760 --> 01:19.510
<i>I want to shout out my secret, AHHH</i>

01:21.430 --> 01:23.970
<i>Take that! Telepathy</i>

01:23.970 --> 01:26.440
<i>Te-te-te-telepathy</i>

01:27.140 --> 01:29.520
<i>Telepathy</i>

01:31.070 --> 01:35.030
<b>Birthday</b>

01:31.070 --> 01:35.030
<b>Present</b>

01:31.900 --> 01:33.730
"Birthday Present."

01:35.740 --> 01:37.530
Here. For you.

01:37.700 --> 01:38.700
Huh?

01:38.700 --> 01:40.660
You wanted these, right?

01:43.870 --> 01:47.080
Thanks! But why?

01:47.080 --> 01:49.500
Today's your birthday, remember?

01:49.500 --> 01:51.960
Oh, yeah! I guess it is!

01:55.550 --> 01:58.800
I'm older than you now!

01:58.800 --> 02:00.840
Show me some respect!

02:00.840 --> 02:03.510
<i>Every single year... This gets so old.</i>

