Good mor—

02:09.650 --> 02:10.900
What are those?

02:11.190 --> 02:13.730
Jun just gave them to me!

02:13.730 --> 02:16.360
My birthday present! Pretty cool, right?

02:16.360 --> 02:20.200
So yeah, I went ahead and turned 16 first!

02:20.200 --> 02:22.120
Indeed. Happy birthday.

02:22.830 --> 02:25.700
You're welcome to call me 
"Onee-san" if you want.

