02:32.420 --> 02:33.500
From me.

02:33.500 --> 02:36.920
Wow, really? Thanks!

02:37.260 --> 02:39.720
Oh, it's pretty heavy. What's in it?

02:40.800 --> 02:42.220
Reference books.

02:43.510 --> 02:45.970
Th-Thanks...

02:45.970 --> 02:48.430
I'm so glad you like it.

03:04.160 --> 03:07.490
Happy birthday, dear—

03:04.910 --> 03:05.870
Wait!

03:06.240 --> 03:07.490
Wait, wait, wait!

03:08.540 --> 03:11.420
Um... What is this?

03:11.420 --> 03:12.540
It's gold.

03:12.540 --> 03:15.000
I have a bigger one at home,

03:15.000 --> 03:17.000
but it was too heavy to carry to school.

03:17.300 --> 03:20.670
I'm happy, but... this is 
definitely too much.

03:21.930 --> 03:24.890
Would you be interested in putting 
that wealth of yours to use?

03:24.890 --> 03:25.800
Misuzu-chan!

03:25.800 --> 03:26.350
No!

03:26.560 --> 03:27.930
Don't team up with her!

03:29.680 --> 03:33.730
Tomo, want to come over 
to my house this weekend?

03:33.730 --> 03:35.730
We're gonna give you a big transformation!

03:40.150 --> 03:43.990
<b>Saturday</b>

03:41.150 --> 03:43.990
What's all this about transforming me?

03:44.200 --> 03:48.080
You're gonna dress me up like you 
did the day I went out with Jun?

03:48.540 --> 03:50.660
First, you're putting on this skirt.

03:50.660 --> 03:51.620
A skirt?!

03:52.080 --> 03:53.620
Put this on, too.

03:53.620 --> 03:54.420
A hairpiece?!

03:54.420 --> 03:55.500
A wig.

03:55.710 --> 03:58.130
So... what does all this mean?

03:58.130 --> 04:02.930
It means we're using this opportunity 
to make you as feminine as possible.

04:03.260 --> 04:05.340
So I'm gonna dress like a girl?!

04:05.340 --> 04:07.720
You say that as if you're <i>not</i> a girl.

04:11.020 --> 04:13.270
Well? Aren't you done yet?

04:13.270 --> 04:15.150
We're still on the basics.

04:17.440 --> 04:20.530
It's kind of a weird feeling, though.

04:20.530 --> 04:21.570
What is?

04:21.990 --> 04:24.740
Me wearing makeup, I mean.

04:25.740 --> 04:28.030
If I did it right,

04:28.030 --> 04:31.000
could I have a pretty face like this, too?

04:38.210 --> 04:39.250
Take over.

04:39.550 --> 04:40.750
'Kay!

04:41.130 --> 04:41.960
Huh?

04:46.930 --> 04:49.640
H-H-How do I look?

04:49.640 --> 04:51.350
You're pretty, Tomo-chan!

04:51.350 --> 04:52.270
Indeed.

04:52.560 --> 04:54.480
R-Really?!

04:54.480 --> 04:58.190
Since we've done all this, 
try talking more like a girl, too.

04:58.190 --> 05:01.940
More like a girl? But I don't know how to...

05:01.940 --> 05:03.990
Just start by speaking more politely.

05:05.110 --> 05:09.450
H-Hello. My name is Aizawa Tomo.

05:09.950 --> 05:11.910
It's a pleasure to meet you.

05:13.290 --> 05:14.910
Am I doing this right?

05:14.910 --> 05:17.370
You're super cute!

05:17.370 --> 05:19.920
Indeed. Boys would probably like it.

05:19.920 --> 05:20.790
Huh?!

05:21.210 --> 05:23.880
I don't think you could make 
friends with them, though.

05:23.880 --> 05:25.720
You'd just be a thorn in their sides.

05:26.380 --> 05:27.970
What's that supposed to mean?

05:31.390 --> 05:34.600
I'm suddenly craving some ice cream.

05:34.600 --> 05:35.980
Me, too.

05:35.980 --> 05:38.850
Oh, I'll go buy some, then.

05:38.850 --> 05:41.070
You've both done a lot for me, after all.

05:41.070 --> 05:42.150
Really?

05:42.150 --> 05:43.690
Sorry to make you do this.

05:43.690 --> 05:45.280
Don't worry about it!

05:45.780 --> 05:48.160
Just... let me change fir—

05:49.110 --> 05:50.160
Wha—

05:50.160 --> 05:52.950
Hey! Are you seriously making 
me go out dressed like this?!

05:52.950 --> 05:54.370
Absolutely.

05:54.370 --> 05:58.460
There's no point in dressing like that 
if we're the only ones who see it.

05:58.460 --> 05:59.500
Yeah, but...

05:59.500 --> 06:00.790
Off you go.

06:00.790 --> 06:02.590
I wish you luck.

06:02.800 --> 06:04.170
Hey! Misuz—

06:08.380 --> 06:10.760
<i>Damn those two!</i>

06:14.640 --> 06:18.390
<i>They're staring at me! 
I guess I really do look weird!</i>

06:18.770 --> 06:20.850
<i>Wait, Jun?!</i>

06:23.440 --> 06:27.440
<i>What do I do?! What excuse can 
I give for being dressed like this?!</i>

06:29.150 --> 06:30.530
<i>H-Huh?</i>

06:30.820 --> 06:34.580
<i>Not sure what that's about, but... 
if he doesn't recognize me, I'm golden!</i>

06:34.580 --> 06:36.620
<i>I'll just buy my stuff and get outta here!</i>

06:37.080 --> 06:40.580
<i>There's no way. There's no damn way.</i>

06:40.920 --> 06:43.500
<i>Okay! I gotta get away from here quick!</i>

06:48.420 --> 06:51.140
Whoa, are you okay?

06:55.350 --> 06:58.310
<i>Her face looks just like Tomo's,</i>

06:58.310 --> 07:02.060
<i>but she doesn't wear stuff like this. She doesn't wear makeup, either.</i>

07:02.770 --> 07:05.440
<i>If this is Tomo, I don't... I mean...</i>

07:05.440 --> 07:06.530
<i>I can't.</i>

07:07.990 --> 07:09.740
Do you need a hand?

07:14.530 --> 07:18.040
<i>Wh-What is this soft touch he's using?</i>

07:20.330 --> 07:21.370
Whoa...

07:22.330 --> 07:23.670
Are you okay?

07:23.670 --> 07:25.840
<i>Why is he treating me like this?</i>

07:27.800 --> 07:29.510
Well, I'll be going now.

07:30.800 --> 07:32.510
U-Um...

07:34.640 --> 07:38.020
Would you mind if I walked 
with you... for a while?

07:39.350 --> 07:41.440
<i>What the heck was I thinking?!</i>

07:41.440 --> 07:43.850
<i>What do I do now?!</i>

07:44.060 --> 07:46.650
<i>Now that we're walking together,
 I'm sure of it.</i>

07:46.650 --> 07:48.820
<i>This girl isn't Tomo.</i>

07:49.110 --> 07:51.780
<i>Tomo's a little shorter than she is.</i>

07:52.360 --> 07:56.120
Um, please don't look at me so much.

07:56.120 --> 07:57.740
Oh, I'm sorry.

07:58.990 --> 08:02.040
I really do look strange, don't I?

08:02.040 --> 08:04.540
Even I realize that.

08:04.540 --> 08:05.210
Huh?

08:05.750 --> 08:09.050
No, I think you just look pretty.

08:10.170 --> 08:13.260
<i>Today's the day I die, isn't it?!</i>

08:14.050 --> 08:15.090
That's it!

08:15.090 --> 08:16.470
There you go!

08:17.390 --> 08:18.760
You got it!

08:21.980 --> 08:23.020
Way to go!

08:27.690 --> 08:28.770
Here I go!

08:28.940 --> 08:31.240
<i>That kid's pretty good.</i>

08:31.440 --> 08:32.530
Go, go!

08:32.990 --> 08:34.610
<i>That's it! Go!</i>

08:34.610 --> 08:36.120
<i>Shoot!</i>

08:36.120 --> 08:38.370
Aw, so close!

08:38.370 --> 08:39.240
Huh?

08:39.240 --> 08:40.040
Huh?

08:42.370 --> 08:46.460
I'm sorry. I like watching sports and such.

08:46.460 --> 08:47.670
That's surprising.

08:47.670 --> 08:50.500
I get all fired up when I watch them.

08:50.500 --> 08:52.630
That's not very ladylike, is it?

08:52.630 --> 08:55.800
I don't know if it's ladylike or not,

08:56.300 --> 08:58.600
but I like people like that.

08:59.260 --> 09:02.560
<i>What's with him today?! 
Is he trying to kill me?!</i>

09:02.930 --> 09:05.730
Those two are pretty good, aren't they?

09:05.730 --> 09:09.270
Huh? Oh... Yes, they do stand out.

09:09.900 --> 09:11.440
They're clearly good friends.

09:11.440 --> 09:13.240
Even though they're a boy and a girl...

09:14.070 --> 09:17.700
What do you think will happen 
to them in the future?

09:17.700 --> 09:20.370
Huh? Well, uh...

09:20.370 --> 09:23.910
I-It'd be nice if they became 
boyfriend and girlfriend.

09:24.620 --> 09:27.210
I figured you'd say that.

09:27.210 --> 09:28.000
Huh?!

09:29.210 --> 09:31.250
I have someone like that, too.

09:31.250 --> 09:34.720
A girl who's... basically my best friend.

09:35.840 --> 09:41.180
But lately, things aren't the same 
as they were when we were kids.

09:41.680 --> 09:45.270
How would you like things to 
turn out with her in the future?

09:45.270 --> 09:48.190
Well, I haven't really 
given it much thought.

09:48.190 --> 09:50.150
Well, you need to think about it!

09:51.820 --> 09:54.320
My goal for the time being is...

09:55.280 --> 09:57.110
to beat her, I guess.

09:57.110 --> 09:57.820
Be—

09:58.490 --> 10:01.740
<i>At this point... should I just tell him?</i>

10:01.740 --> 10:03.410
<i>I'll tell him I'm Tomo!</i>

10:03.410 --> 10:06.710
<i>Then maybe he'll see me 
as a little bit more...</i>

10:06.960 --> 10:09.880
Um, there's something I've been wondering...

10:09.880 --> 10:10.580
Huh?!

10:11.250 --> 10:14.630
You bought ice cream at the 
convenience store. Is it okay out here?

10:19.760 --> 10:21.260
Oh, crap!

10:21.510 --> 10:24.970
Th-Thank you so much for all you've done today!

10:24.970 --> 10:26.310
Uh, hang on...

10:26.310 --> 10:28.190
I'd better be going now!

10:31.440 --> 10:34.150
It couldn't be... right?

10:36.320 --> 10:38.150
Sorry I took so long!

10:38.150 --> 10:41.320
A lot happened on the... way...

10:41.320 --> 10:43.780
<b>Happy Birthday
 Tomo-chan</b>

