<b>Happy Birthday
 Tomo-chan</b>

10:41.320 --> 10:43.780
<b>Happy Birthday
 Tomo-chan</b>

10:41.320 --> 10:43.780
<b>Happy Birthday
 Tomo-chan</b>

10:41.320 --> 10:43.780
<b>Happy Birthday
 Tomo-chan</b>

10:41.320 --> 10:43.780
<b>Happy Birthday
 Tomo-chan</b>

10:41.320 --> 10:43.780
<b>Happy Birthday
 Tomo-chan</b>

10:45.740 --> 10:48.330
This homemade cake is really good!

10:48.330 --> 10:50.000
Thanks, both of you!

10:50.330 --> 10:54.460
Forget about that. Did you really see 
Junichiro at the convenience store?

10:54.460 --> 10:55.420
Oh, yeah...

10:55.420 --> 10:57.420
He said I looked pretty.

10:57.420 --> 11:00.050
Wow! That's great!

11:00.050 --> 11:06.100
Well... If I'm being honest, 
I was super happy when he said it.

11:06.430 --> 11:12.060
But I guess what I really want to 
hear him say is something else.

11:12.350 --> 11:14.820
You mean you'd rather be 
called cute than pretty?

11:14.820 --> 11:17.280
Let's try for that next time.

11:17.280 --> 11:20.070
Uh, no, that's not what I meant...

11:24.990 --> 11:26.290
What?

11:31.710 --> 11:34.710
That hurt, damn it! 
What the hell are you doing?!

11:34.710 --> 11:35.960
Yeah, that's right.

11:37.420 --> 11:39.670
That punch could only come from Tomo!

11:40.220 --> 11:44.050
Why are you happy?! 
A-Are you some kinda freak?!

11:46.010 --> 11:50.020
<b>Burn Up!</b>

11:46.010 --> 11:50.020
<b>The Ball Sports Tournament</b>

11:46.560 --> 11:49.220
"Burn Up! The Ball Sports Tournament."

11:56.270 --> 11:59.070
Damn. I missed.

12:00.990 --> 12:03.610
Hey! Why are you running away?

12:03.950 --> 12:06.370
Tomo-chan is kinda scary.

12:06.370 --> 12:09.620
Because the class-versus-class ball 
sports tournament is coming up.

12:10.080 --> 12:13.330
She's always like that 
before an athletic event.

12:13.920 --> 12:16.790
Uh, so... For certain reasons...

12:17.210 --> 12:23.630
Aizawa-san will be on the boys' dodgeball 
team at the ball sports tournament.

12:23.630 --> 12:25.090
All right!

12:25.260 --> 12:28.440
This is awesome, Tomo! We can play together!

12:28.810 --> 12:31.890
<i>Why did this happen again?!</i>

12:31.890 --> 12:36.860
<b>The Day of the Ball Sports Tournament</b>

12:36.860 --> 12:40.610
<b>First Round</b>

12:40.780 --> 12:44.530
I heard there's a girl on the team 
we're playing in the first round.

12:45.530 --> 12:47.570
For real? This'll be a cakewalk!

12:47.950 --> 12:49.330
We're ready!

12:49.330 --> 12:50.290
Ready!

12:50.450 --> 12:53.580
Sure, we'll play around with ya.

12:53.790 --> 12:55.920
And we'll be giving this all we've got.

12:56.380 --> 12:58.460
You'd better make sure you're prepared.

13:03.050 --> 13:06.050
<b>VS. Third-Year Punk Team</b>

13:04.130 --> 13:06.050
<b>Instant Victory</b>

13:06.050 --> 13:07.430
<b>Second Round</b>

13:09.300 --> 13:11.430
Let's have a good, fair match!

13:11.430 --> 13:12.270
Yeah.

13:12.430 --> 13:15.770
I know I don't have to hold 
back against you, Senpai!

13:15.770 --> 13:17.600
Let's make it a good game.

13:17.600 --> 13:18.230
Wha...

13:18.730 --> 13:21.940
Everyone, put your own 
safety above all else!

13:21.940 --> 13:25.610
Let's finish this match with 
everyone still standing!

13:26.160 --> 13:27.570
What're you talking about?

13:27.570 --> 13:29.450
It's just a dodgeball match.

13:33.750 --> 13:36.370
Misaki!

13:36.370 --> 13:38.880
<b>VS. Misaki-senpai and His Classmates</b>

13:36.370 --> 13:38.880
<b>Overwhelming Victory</b>

13:42.760 --> 13:44.970
Well, the final round's next.

13:44.970 --> 13:45.840
Yeah.

13:46.340 --> 13:48.140
Hey! We've got trouble!

13:48.140 --> 13:50.300
One of the guys on the other team 
in the finals is like a gorilla!

13:50.720 --> 13:54.600
That third-year in the judo club, 
Goma Takeru-senpai, right?

13:55.180 --> 13:58.100
The guy known as the strongest 
kid in the school.

13:58.100 --> 14:00.520
I'm not sure if even Jun and I can beat him.

14:01.020 --> 14:04.360
I knew the day would come eventually 
when we'd have to fight him...

14:04.360 --> 14:07.610
But I didn't think we'd have 
to fight him this soon.

14:07.610 --> 14:10.990
Uh, no... You don't really 
have to fight him.

14:11.330 --> 14:14.120
What are you saying? He's the 
strongest kid in the school!

14:14.120 --> 14:16.210
We've gotta fight him at least once!

14:16.210 --> 14:18.620
Sorry. I don't get you at all.

14:19.960 --> 14:22.880
Too bad we lost at volleyball.

14:22.880 --> 14:26.260
There was no way a team with 
you and me on it could win.

14:26.260 --> 14:27.590
True.

14:28.180 --> 14:31.510
It's just about time for Tomo 
and Junichiro's final round.

14:33.010 --> 14:34.810
What are you snickering about?

14:35.180 --> 14:39.270
I was just thinking, you and I
 are together a lot lately.

14:39.810 --> 14:42.310
Hey, don't go.

14:43.730 --> 14:46.190
<b>Final Round</b>

14:49.860 --> 14:52.570
We'll be giving everything 
we've got to this final round.

14:52.570 --> 14:53.490
Yep!

14:53.490 --> 14:55.790
So you're Aizawa Tomo?

14:55.790 --> 14:57.830
Yeah, that's me.

14:57.830 --> 15:01.250
I heard you were the karate club's ace,

15:01.250 --> 15:03.250
but frankly, I'm disappointed.

15:03.250 --> 15:06.630
I didn't know you'd be such 
a fragile-looking little lady.

15:06.630 --> 15:09.430
"A fragile-looking little lady," he says!

15:09.430 --> 15:11.180
Did you hear that?! Well?!

15:11.180 --> 15:13.890
You do seem fairly strong...

15:14.180 --> 15:18.390
But to be honest, you interest 
me more than Aizawa.

15:18.390 --> 15:19.310
Pardon?

15:19.890 --> 15:23.860
I hear you're pretty athletic, 
but you're not in any clubs.

15:23.860 --> 15:28.280
How about this? If I win this 
match, you join the judo club.

15:28.570 --> 15:32.320
Fine. And if I win...

15:33.660 --> 15:34.950
What should I say?

15:34.950 --> 15:38.040
Way to fall flat at the 
finish line! Don't ask me!

15:39.620 --> 15:43.750
<i>The final round of boys' 
dodgeball will now begin.</i>

15:44.170 --> 15:46.210
<i>Misuzu-chan is cheering me on!</i>

15:46.590 --> 15:49.920
<i>Watch me. I'll win this match for you!</i>

15:53.390 --> 15:55.600
Tanabe!

15:56.810 --> 15:59.140
He was sending you some sort of sign.

15:59.140 --> 16:01.440
Was he? I wasn't watching.

16:01.640 --> 16:03.980
He didn't waste any time!

16:03.980 --> 16:06.150
Hey, Tanabe! You okay?!

16:08.150 --> 16:10.940
Sports are great, aren't they?

16:10.940 --> 16:15.620
It doesn't matter if you hurt someone, 
as long as you follow the rules.

16:15.620 --> 16:18.790
Damn that violent bastard!

16:18.790 --> 16:21.080
What does he think sports are about?!

16:21.080 --> 16:23.330
I don't think he's one to talk.

16:23.330 --> 16:24.790
You can say that again.

16:27.460 --> 16:28.670
Noda!

16:29.130 --> 16:30.840
Fukaya!

16:33.510 --> 16:36.260
Why aren't you throwing the ball at <i>me</i>?!

16:40.850 --> 16:42.560
Don't be impatient.

16:43.520 --> 16:47.270
I took out the guys who aren't fit 
to stand on this court first.

16:47.270 --> 16:51.780
And that means you're next, Aizawa!

16:56.320 --> 16:57.370
Uh-oh!

16:58.580 --> 16:59.990
Jun!

17:05.670 --> 17:08.420
You idiot! What the hell were you doing?!

17:09.500 --> 17:13.590
Dunno. My body just moved on its own.

17:14.430 --> 17:17.930
Stay with me, Jun!

17:18.550 --> 17:20.930
How dare you do that to Jun?

17:22.980 --> 17:25.850
I'm gonna make you pay for that!

17:25.850 --> 17:29.730
Oh? And how are you gonna make me pay?

17:32.610 --> 17:35.740
It's down to a one-on-one between 
Aizawa-san and the gorilla.

17:36.200 --> 17:38.320
Is Aizawa-san gonna be okay?

17:38.320 --> 17:41.410
Don't worry. No one can beat her.

17:41.700 --> 17:44.870
I'm putting my all into this throw!

17:45.210 --> 17:46.870
Here I go!

17:47.500 --> 17:52.840
Take this, damn it!

17:53.840 --> 17:55.300
Bring it on!

17:59.390 --> 18:02.060
<i>It dropped?! A between-the-legs pass?!</i>

18:02.060 --> 18:05.060
I'm not playing by myself here!

18:05.060 --> 18:08.440
Go, Jun!

18:09.900 --> 18:10.810
Huh?

18:12.440 --> 18:13.230
Yah.

18:17.570 --> 18:19.320
<i>That concludes the match.</i>

18:19.740 --> 18:23.790
<i>The boys' dodgeball winner is Class 1-A!</i>

18:23.790 --> 18:25.410
Congratulations.

18:26.580 --> 18:31.210
<i>Everyone, give Class 1-A 
a round of applause!</i>

18:40.890 --> 18:43.390
Tomo-chan, congrats on the win.

18:43.390 --> 18:45.180
Yeah, thanks.

18:45.180 --> 18:47.560
What's wrong? You don't seem happy.

18:47.890 --> 18:52.940
I had so much fun being 
on a team with him today.

18:53.360 --> 18:56.030
It was like we went back to the old days.

18:56.400 --> 19:01.490
It kinda made me wish things 
could stay like this forever.

19:02.490 --> 19:07.040
I hope we can always have the kind of 
relationship where we can goof around together.

19:07.960 --> 19:10.120
But I guess we can't, huh?

19:10.670 --> 19:11.920
<i>Sorry, Tomo.</i>

19:12.210 --> 19:16.210
<i>In the end, I can only do 
things for my own gain.</i>

19:20.680 --> 19:22.640
Hey. Hold up.

19:23.300 --> 19:25.850
You're not satisfied with 
how that ended, are you?

19:26.350 --> 19:28.560
Come with me for a minute.

19:33.770 --> 19:37.360
Wh-What's the idea?! Why...

19:37.360 --> 19:42.320
Why am I getting beat up by you, 
when I do judo and you do karate?!

19:43.280 --> 19:45.280
You let your guard down too much.

19:58.130 --> 19:59.970
<i>I managed to pull off more wins than him.</i>

19:59.970 --> 20:03.260
Damn it... I guess I still 
can't beat you after all.

20:03.680 --> 20:06.510
Is this really an outcome you 
should be depressed over?

20:06.510 --> 20:07.180
Huh?

20:07.180 --> 20:11.140
You didn't even use karate on me once.

20:11.640 --> 20:14.900
At this point, we might as well say I lost.

20:15.560 --> 20:17.520
That's not the problem.

20:18.690 --> 20:20.070
Hang on!

20:20.070 --> 20:23.320
I hear you almost never 
enter any tournaments.

20:23.820 --> 20:25.950
Don't you feel like that's 
a waste of talent?

20:27.080 --> 20:30.290
What was your reason for getting so strong?

20:31.410 --> 20:36.250
I just wanted to catch up to the 
big back I saw in front of me.

20:37.090 --> 20:39.130
But the situation changed,

20:39.130 --> 20:42.420
and now I don't even know 
how to approach it.

20:43.130 --> 20:45.050
What do you think I should do?

20:45.550 --> 20:47.510
Uh... I don't know.

20:49.060 --> 20:51.640
I heard you fought with Goma-senpai.

20:51.640 --> 20:53.640
Yeah, and I lost.

20:54.270 --> 20:55.400
I see.

20:56.480 --> 21:00.150
I lost, but I bet you could beat him.

21:00.150 --> 21:03.700
You know, I've thought this for a while,

21:03.700 --> 21:06.490
but you overestimate me way too much.

21:06.490 --> 21:09.660
Do I? I don't think I'm overestimating you.

21:10.490 --> 21:15.830
Then again, it wouldn't surprise 
me if you started breathing fire.

21:15.830 --> 21:18.420
Oh, you're finally counting 
me as a monster, huh?

21:19.670 --> 21:22.760
You're a guy, and I'm a girl.

21:23.300 --> 21:26.930
You're obviously gonna be better than 
me at any kind of physical contest.

21:28.510 --> 21:32.670
<i>During that match, I wasn't 
expecting that pass at all.</i>

21:33.600 --> 21:37.980
<i>I just believed that you 
would win it in the end.</i>

21:38.910 --> 21:46.650
<i>Maybe I'm still just a gamer kid who's only 
strong-willed because you're by my side.</i>

21:47.220 --> 21:49.040
<i>It's not physical strength.</i>

21:49.890 --> 21:51.010
What's up?

21:51.010 --> 21:53.150
Oh, nothing.

22:01.130 --> 22:02.180
<i>I want...</i>

22:03.770 --> 22:05.900
<i>to be like you.</i>

22:10.800 --> 22:14.560
<i>(This suspicious behavior is...)</i>

22:14.560 --> 22:18.850
<i>Hey, you know, I'm all mixed up</i>

22:18.850 --> 22:23.320
<i>It's too complicated, I'm freaking out</i>

22:23.320 --> 22:25.860
<i>I want to look cute to you</i>

22:23.650 --> 22:29.200
<i>(crazy, crazy, drive me crazy, and that's…)</i>

22:25.860 --> 22:28.490
<i>So I'm plotting, bargaining, 
sly, and stubborn</i>

22:29.200 --> 22:32.990
<i>Dizzying love</i>

22:34.160 --> 22:38.580
<i>Just tell him to look at you</i>

22:38.580 --> 22:43.550
<i>And watch him stiffen up even more, 
because you're both so awkward</i>

22:43.550 --> 22:47.420
<i>What? Even if we're alike in that way</i>

22:47.420 --> 22:52.010
<i>It doesn't make me happy, 'cause it
 means our love is going nowhere</i>

22:52.010 --> 23:00.900
<i>Cloudy heart, swirling emotions—
I sense rain coming</i>

23:00.900 --> 23:09.990
<i>So I partly open my umbrella, 
then sneakily scoot closer to you</i>

23:09.990 --> 23:13.950
<i>Please notice the curl of my 
eyelashes as I keep blinking</i>

23:13.950 --> 23:18.870
<i>And don't say I'm acting weird</i>

23:18.870 --> 23:22.840
<i>All this plotting and bargaining 
is my sly plan to look cute to you</i>

23:22.840 --> 23:27.880
<i>Try to solve the riddle of 
this soft, dizzying love</i>

23:25.750 --> 23:30.010
<i>(Buzzing, fidgeting)</i>

23:30.260 --> 23:34.430
<i>Listen, I might be a bit 
tangled in my own web now</i>

23:34.430 --> 23:38.850
<i>But once you unravel the mystery, 
you'll see pure lo-love</i>
